fixture dash_eight_way
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash: "Direction: 8-way in air"
room test/flat
frames 30
input
  0..3 jump
  4 U R dash
end
expect
  # 20 u/f along the diagonal: 5120 * 707 / 1000, rounded, on each axis.
  at 4 state=dash vx=3620 vy=-3620
  during 4..12 vx=3620 vy=-3620
  # Carry-over halves both axes, and gravity (171 sp/f² rising) acts from the first carry frame.
  at 13 carry>0 vx=1810 vy=-1639
end
